  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nI'd like to request that support be added to the SSO system to allow for Single log-out support in apps like Authentik - Specifically back-channel logout as it would ensure the user is logged out regardless of whether their browser is open\n\nAn example would be this: User logs out on Authentik, Authentik reaches out to the end-point provided by Homarr and tells Homarr to log the user out\nThis would allow the user to be either logged out by an administrator on Authentik, or for the user to log themselves out\n\nWithout this, SSO feels janky as even if the user is fully deleted from Authentik, Homarr will continue to serve that user until they log out specifically on Homarr\n\n### Additional information\n\n**Links from Authentik that may be useful:**\nhttps://docs.goauthentik.io/add-secure-apps/providers/single-logout/\nhttps://docs.goauthentik.io/add-secure-apps/providers/oauth2/frontchannel_and_backchannel_logout/#back-channel-logout\n\nThank you for your time and consideration! \ud83d\ude04 ",
